        <detaileddescription>
<para>Inform the device that the DFU file is fully uploaded. To return the device back to user application mode, issue command <ref refid="group__sl__bt__system_1gafed89f60b9ee973bcb22e7e891a13e43" kindref="member">sl_bt_system_reboot</ref>.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="return"><para>SL_STATUS_OK if successful. Error code otherwise. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
